      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "QUEEN FLOW (2) goes very well at the course and distance with three wins and a placing from six starts. In the money last time at Murray Bridge Straight (19.76) in a Grade 6, finishing a 4 length third. Looks a leading chance on best. MASTER KILCOY (7) racing well without winning, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 3rd in a Other on October 27 over 342m at this track behind Blue Energy beaten one length (20.15). Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Expected to feature again. QUICK STRIKE (8) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a neck second (19.96) behind Photo Crusher at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Well-placed to take this out. KOOKABURRA GRACE (5) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
